[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2977658540","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107577#issuecomment-2977658540","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107577","id":2977658540,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xe3as","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-16T18:35:13Z","updated_at":"2025-06-16T18:35:59Z","body":"> Even though `Basis` is a struct implemented directly in C# without a native reference, it is registered for disposing.\r\n\r\nThe `Basis` instance is not registered for disposing, the code you are changing is in `Variant`. The `Variant` type is a wrapper over the native type and may need disposing the native reference.\r\n\r\n> It seems like `Basis` is one of five structs (`Projection`, `Aabb`, `Basis`, `Transform2D`, `Transform3D`) that are eligible for bypassing disposing but don't.\r\n\r\nThe `Variant` type is an union defined like this:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/46c495ca21f40f57a7fb9c7cde6143738f1652d4/core/variant/variant.h#L264-L276\r\n\r\nAs you can see, the struct types you mentioned are stored as pointers, which means they are allocated somewhere else and we have to free them when disposing the `Variant` or we'd end up with a leak on the native side.\r\n\r\nYou can also see which types actually need to be disposed in [`needs_deinit`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/46c495ca21f40f57a7fb9c7cde6143738f1652d4/core/variant/variant.h#L282-L326), and we definitely need to match that for correctness.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2977658540/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2977777218","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107577#issuecomment-2977777218","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107577","id":2977777218,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xfUZC","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-16T19:10:12Z","updated_at":"2025-06-16T19:10:12Z","body":"I see. Looks like Variants can only hold up to 16 bytes. Plane is 16 bytes whereas Aabb and Transform2D are 24 bytes. Thank you @raulsntos","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2977777218/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]